      "type": "AUTOMATION_RUN",
      "transition": "push",
      "background": "zoneA",
      "narration": "Rung two, if reading it didn't do it. Run headed with slow-mo five hundred and every action takes half a second. Suddenly you can watch. Nine times in ten you spot it with your eyes — the click landing on a cookie banner.",
